# Only src/, server/, docs/ROADMAP.md (for /roadmap) and the app's version and changelog (for the web app) are needed;
# keep everything else (and all secrets/data) out of the image.
*
!src/**
!server/**
!docs/ROADMAP.md
!package.json
!CHANGELOG.md
server/node_modules
server/dist
server/dist-test
server/.data
server/.env
**/.DS_Store
